al ministry while continuing to perform merengue. On 23 September 2026 he marked five decades in music with a concert at Santo Domingo''s Estadio Olímpico Félix Sánchez, joined by performers from several generations, including "},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"c11c2dda-ffa1-4f09-9d24-00dc4473bc8d","displayText":"Cuco Valoy","occurrenceId":"5dde2915-7cba-434d-84ce-bca7d9dad59d"}},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"fb068903-a085-4a3f-b846-0be0b3e28934","displayText":"Henry García","occurrenceId":"fb352ba9-75e0-4ec3-9e13-70e415d4c3a7"}},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"bb114227-a160-4f45-960e-b6c1710fbeef","displayText":"Peter Cruz","occurrenceId":"853668eb-38cc-4767-b344-4ed0fe9d73ed"}},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"070e7449-814e-4ea6-a009-7a091b7e4878","displayText":"Milly Quezada","occurrenceId":"ea8ef381-b4b9-4cbe-9a95-43dc70650138"}},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"10034596-47cb-46ba-9e80-9ea319a2c0df","displayText":"Juan Luis Guerra","occurrenceId":"12a3f915-54bf-4c8d-8ec2-c514cf6fd0eb"}},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Legacy","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ramón Orlando''s career connects family training, orchestral writing, production for other performers and the leadership of his own projects. His work traces a path through Dominican merengue from «La Tribu» in the 1970s to the large orchestras and concerts of later decades."}]}]}'::jsonb,6);
SELECT * FROM public.upsert_editorial_document('artist_biography','c11c2dda-ffa1-4f09-9d24-00dc4473bc8d','es',1,'published',jsonb_set((SELECT document FROM editorial_documents WHERE id='3f978fc5-e7ec-4ecd-9e99-d168b7edec17' AND revision=5 AND status='published' AND document->'content'->7->'content'->0->>'text' LIKE 'En 1975 formó Los Virtuosos.%'),'{content,7}','{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cuco preparó «Los Virtuosos» junto a su hijo "},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"02f23257-1cf6-4a4c-8df1-1f9aa630a2c3","displayText":"Ramón Orlando","occurrenceId":"1490e55b-b5ee-44a5-b797-b59a29bbc98a"}},{"type":"text","text":", a quien había encaminado al piano desde niño. Ensayaron durante años antes de las primeras presentaciones profesionales de 1975. Cuco definía la dirección y aportaba repertorio e ideas para las canciones; Ramón escribía arreglos, tocaba el piano y asumía la dirección musical. La agrupación adoptó después el nombre de «La Tribu»."}]}'::jsonb),5);
SELECT * FROM public.upsert_editorial_document('artist_biography','c11c2dda-ffa1-4f09-9d24-00dc4473bc8d','en',1,'published',jsonb_set((SELECT document FROM editorial_documents WHERE id='a741e62b-e30d-4e43-8110-04690e816bd1' AND revision=6 AND status='published' AND document->'content'->7->'content'->0->>'text' LIKE 'In 1975 he formed Los Virtuosos.%'),'{content,7}','{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cuco prepared «Los Virtuosos» with his son "},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"02f23257-1cf6-4a4c-8df1-1f9aa630a2c3","displayText":"Ramón Orlando","occurrenceId":"ae91eff4-59ef-45b6-b083-563331a0f962"}},{"type":"text","text":", whom he had steered toward piano as a child. They rehearsed for years before their first professional performances in 1975. Cuco set the direction and brought repertoire and song ideas; Ramón wrote arrangements, played piano and served as musical director. The ensemble later adopted the name «La Tribu»."}]}'::jsonb),6);
UPDATE artists SET bio_es=replace(bio_es,'En 1975 formó Los Virtuosos. Había encaminado a su hijo Ramón Orlando hacia el piano desde los siete años; el joven se incorporó como pianista, arreglista y director musical. Cuco aportaba el repertorio y las ideas de las canciones, y su hijo desarrollaba sus arreglos para la orquesta.','Cuco preparó «Los Virtuosos» junto a su hijo Ramón Orlando, a quien había encaminado al piano desde niño. Ensayaron durante años antes de las primeras presentaciones profesionales de 1975. Cuco definía la dirección y aportaba repertorio e ideas para las canciones; Ramón escribía arreglos, tocaba el piano y asumía la dirección musical. La agrupación adoptó después el nombre de «La Tribu».'),bio_en=replace(bio_en,'In 1975 he formed Los Virtuosos. He had steered his son Ramón Orlando towards piano from the age of seven; the young musician joined as pianist, arranger and musical director. Cuco brought repertoire and song ideas, while his son developed the arrangements for the orchestra.','Cuco prepared «Los Virtuosos» with his son Ramón Orlando, whom he had steered toward piano as a child. They rehearsed for years before their first professional performances in 1975. Cuco set the direction and brought repertoire and song ideas; Ramón wrote arrangements, played piano and served as musical director. The ensemble later adopted the name «La Tribu».') WHERE id='c11c2dda-ffa1-4f09-9d24-00dc4473bc8d' AND status='published' AND position('En 1975 formó Los Virtuosos. Había encaminado a su hijo Ramón Orlando hacia el piano desde los siete años; el joven se incorporó como pianista, arreglista y director musical. Cuco aportaba el repertorio y las ideas de las canciones, y su hijo desarrollaba sus arreglos para la orquesta.' in bio_es)>0 AND position('In 1975 he formed Los Virtuosos. He had steered his son Ramón Orlando towards piano from the age of seven; the young musician joined as pianist, arranger and musical director. Cuco brought repertoire and song ideas, while his son developed the arrangements for the orchestra.' in bio_en)>0;
DO $verify$ BEGIN IF NOT (
  (SELECT count(*)=1 FROM artists WHERE id='02f23257-1cf6-4a4c-8df1-1f9aa630a2c3' AND birth_place='Santo Domingo' AND province='Distrito Nacional' AND second_last_name='García' AND status='published' AND bio_es LIKE 'Ramón Orlando Valoy García,%' AND bio_en LIKE 'Ramón Orlando Valoy García,%')
  AND (SELECT count(*)=1 FROM artists WHERE id='c11c2dda-ffa1-4f09-9d24-00dc4473bc8d' AND status='published' AND bio_es LIKE '%Cuco preparó «Los Virtuosos» junto a su hijo Ramón Orlando%' AND bio_en LIKE '%Cuco prepared «Los Virtuosos» with his son Ramón Orlando%')
  AND (SELECT count(*)=4 FROM editorial_documents WHERE (id='560a9787-972f-476f-9543-785c6c5f4d06' AND revision=6 AND status='published') OR (id='ae4945d7-8056-4879-8eb1-4cfd84f2717e' AND revision=7 AND status='published') OR (id='3f978fc5-e7ec-4ecd-9e99-d168b7edec17' AND revision=6 AND status='published') OR (id='a741e62b-e30d-4e43-8110-04690e816bd1' AND revision=7 AND status='published'))
  ) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Approved editorial save verification failed'; END IF; END $verify$;
COMMIT;
